{"id":437,"title":"挑战1: 寻找两数和为n","summary":"写一个函数来寻找加起来等于n的两个数字。\n","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ef4a2e08-f368-47f6-9a8d-f6233b371de9","text":"## 问题\n\n请实现`find_sum(lst, n)`函数，该函数将接收一个列表`lst`和数字`n`作为输入，并从列表中返回两个相加和为`n`的数字。\n\n### 输入\n\n一个列表和一个数字`n`。\n\n### 输出\n\n列表中的两个整数`a`和`b`，相加和为`n`。\n\n### 示例输入\n\n```python\nlst = [1, 21, 3, 14, 5, 60, 7, 6]\nn = 81\n```\n\n### 示例输出\n\n```python\nresult = [21, 60]\n```\n\n例如，下图中，假设数字`n`为81，当遍历整个列表时，发现**21**和**60**是加起来等于**81**。则返回`[21, 60]`。","text_html":"<h2>问题</h2>\n<p>请实现<code>find_sum(lst, n)</code>函数，该函数将接收一个列表<code>lst</code>和数字<code>n</code>作为输入，并从列表中返回两个相加和为<code>n</code>的数字。</p>\n<h3>输入</h3>\n<p>一个列表和一个数字<code>n</code>。</p>\n<h3>输出</h3>\n<p>列表中的两个整数<code>a</code>和<code>b</code>，相加和为<code>n</code>。</p>\n<h3>示例输入</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">lst = [1, 21, 3, 14, 5, 60, 7, 6]\nn = 81\n</code></pre>\n<h3>示例输出</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">result = [21, 60]\n</code></pre>\n<p>例如，下图中，假设数字<code>n</code>为81，当遍历整个列表时，发现<strong>21</strong>和<strong>60</strong>是加起来等于<strong>81</strong>。则返回<code>[21, 60]</code>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"CanvasAnimation","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"495cb9c8-905c-4d30-a049-fcc5c6561e16","width":700,"height":200,"canvas_objects":[{"caption":"find_sum(lst, 81)","width":700,"height":200,"canvas_json":"{\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"path-group\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":446,\"top\":64.22,\"width\":76,\"height\":16,\"fill\":\"\",\"stroke\":null,\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1.23,\"scaleY\":1.52,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":true,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\":null,\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"fillRule\":\"nonzero\",\"globalCompositeOperation\":\"source-over\",\"transformMatrix\":null,\"skewX\":0,\"skewY\":0,\"paths\":[{\"t