战\n\n首先，请仔细阅读题目，在实现之前先思考算法。最初请尝试自己解决它。如果卡住了，可随时参考下一节的答案。\n\nGood luck!","text_html":"<h2>编码挑战</h2>\n<p>首先，请仔细阅读题目，在实现之前先思考算法。最初请尝试自己解决它。如果卡住了，可随时参考下一节的答案。</p>\n<p>Good luck!</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f3b7e6dd-f891-47e0-b43c-cbe3d7ddfa4f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Write your code here!\n    pass","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":true,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":true,"solution_content":"def find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    found_values = set()\n\n    for ele in lst:\n        if n - ele in found_values:\n            return [n - ele, ele]\n        found_values.add(ele)\n\n    return False\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":{"author_code":" # Educative's Test Runner calls 'executeTests' that \n# should return an array of TestResult (defined below).\n# Each TestResult object forms a Row in the output table\n\n# The following sample is for testing the function \n# 'square' which takes an integer and returns an integer\n# e.g.\n# def square(n):\n#   return n * n\n\nclass TestResult():\n  def __init__(self):\n    self.succeeded = False;  # Whether this test succeeded or not\n    self.reason = \"\"  # What's the reason (specially if failed)\n    self.input = \"\"  # What was the input?\n    self.expected_output = \"\"  # What was the expected output?\n    self.actual_output = \"\"  # What was the output when this test ran\n    \ndef executeTests():\n  inputs = [1, 21, 3, 14, 5, 60, 7, 6]\n  expected_outputs = [21, 60]\n  results = []\n    \n  result = TestResult()\n  result.input = 'find_sum('+str(inputs)+',81)'\n  result.expected_output = str(expected_outputs)\n    \n  actual_output = find_sum(inputs, 81)\n  result.actual_output = str(actual_output)\n    \n  if actual_output and sum(actual_output) == sum(expected_outputs):\n    result.succeeded = True\n    result.reason = \"Succeeded\"\n  else:\n    result.succeeded = False\n    result.reason = \"Incorrect Output\"\n    \n  results.append(result)\n  \n  return results","ed_code":"import json\r\ndef main():\r\n  results = executeTests()\r\n  test_results = []\r\n\r\n  for result in results:\r\n    jres = {}\r\n    jres[\"succeeded\"] = result.succeeded\r\n    jres[\"reason\"] = result.reason\r\n    jres[\"input\"] = result.input\r\n    jres[\"expected_output\"] = result.expected_output\r\n    jres[\"actual_output\"] = result.actual_output\r\n\r\n    test_results.append(jres)\r\n\r\n  output = {\"test_results\": test_results}\r\n  json_output = json.dumps(output)\r\n\r\n  print(\"<__educative_test_results__>\" + json_output + \"</__educative_test_results__>\")\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n  main()","test_output_on_console":false,"user_code_string_format":"class EdTestMetadata:\r\n  def __init__(self):\r\n      self.userCode = \"{0}\"\r\n\r\nedTestMetadata = EdTestMetadata()"},"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"053e674a-ef9e-4024-91f1-9dc3d4864f05","text":"---\n\n让我们在下一课看参考答案!","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>让我们在下一课看参考答案!</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/437"}
